WEBVTT

00:06:27.239 --> 00:06:31.784
As a profession, we have to stop this. The science is clear.

00:06:31.784 --> 00:06:34.079
Here's what we know.

00:06:34.079 --> 00:06:40.054
We know that the problem begins immediately.

00:06:40.054 --> 00:06:43.963
Right? This idea, zero to three.

00:06:43.963 --> 00:06:46.449
My wife, Yvonne, and I, we have four kids,

00:06:46.449 --> 00:06:49.956
three grown ones and a 15-year-old.

00:06:49.956 --> 00:06:51.443
That's a longer story.

00:06:51.443 --> 00:06:53.092
(Laughter)

00:06:53.092 --> 00:06:56.171
With our first kids, we did not know the science

00:06:56.171 --> 00:06:58.011
about brain development.

00:06:58.011 --> 00:07:00.625
We didn't know how critical those first three years were.